<title>USA: MNB Bancshares sets dividends.</title>
<headline>MNB Bancshares sets dividends.</headline>
<dateline>MANHATTAN, Kansas 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>MNB Bancshares Inc said Monday it declared a five percent stock dividend and a $0.125 per share cash dividend, both payable on May 15 to shareholders of record on April 30 and May 1, respectively.</p>
<p>The company said it marks the fourth consecutive year it declared a five percent stock dividend.</p>
